webview-fallback-title = The launcher interface could not be displayed.
webview-fallback-linux-page-never-loaded = The web engine started, but the launcher page never appeared. This usually means WebKit can't draw on this desktop or GPU. Start the launcher with STARLIGHT_WEBVIEW_OFFSCREEN=1, or with STARLIGHT_WEBVIEW_BACKEND=wpe if WPE WebKit is installed, or use the Flatpak version. If none of that helps, please send us the newest file from the logs folder below.
webview-fallback-linux-no-engine = No usable web engine was found. Install the WebKitGTK package for your distribution (webkit2gtk-4.1 / libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 / webkit2gtk-4.0) and start the launcher again. On SteamOS / Steam Deck, or if you can't install packages, use the Flatpak version instead - it ships its own WebKitGTK.
webview-fallback-engine-failed = The embedded web engine failed to start. Please check the launcher logs.
webview-fallback-logs = Logs: { $path }
